+          <Bi en="A short’s loss has no ceiling, and 複委託 usually cannot short: record here only what a broker actually allows." zh="做空的虧損沒有上限，且複委託通常不能放空：請只記錄券商實際允許的交易。" />
+        </>
+      )}
+    </div>
+  );
